train.jsonl and test.jsonl are a derived slice of:

    databricks/databricks-dolly-15k
    © Databricks, Inc.
    https://huggingface.co/datasets/databricks/databricks-dolly-15k
    retrieved 2026-08-14, source sha256
    2df9083338b4abd6bceb5635764dab5d833b393b55759dffb0959b6fcbf794ec

The dataset card licenses that data under CC BY-SA 3.0 and states it may be used
for any purpose, academic or commercial, under those terms. Two of those terms
travel with this slice:

  Attribution — credit Databricks, Inc. as above.
  ShareAlike  — distribute derivatives of this data under CC BY-SA 3.0.

Selection and field remapping (context -> input, response -> output, category
dropped) are recorded in slice-manifest.json and reproducible with
datasets/build-dolly-slice.mjs. No record text was altered.

Recorded 2026-08-16, correcting an earlier note in this repository that gave the
licence as Apache 2.0. It was checked against the dataset card, which is the
primary source; see docs/CLAIMS_AUDIT.md.
